<p>• Synchronization of filling heads.</p></div><div class="tab-pane fade" id="o_adp_tab_asepticfillingmachin_2_c3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="o_adp_tab_asepticfillingmachin_2_l3"><p>• Dual dosing system:<br/>
