– Version up to 5 kilos<br/>
– Version up to 10 kilos<br/>
• Dosing accuracy: ± 0.2%.</p>
<p>• Dating system: Transfer by thermal tape.</p>
<p>• Steam: 4 bar. (Clean steam for food).</p>
<p>• Sterilizing agent: Peroxide 35% hydrogen</p>
<p>• Supply voltage: 220 / 440V   Three phase, 50 / 60Hz.</p>
<p>• Compressed air: 3 CFM at a pressure of 100 PSIG, (clean, free of particles, dry and without oil).</p>
